          </p>
          <a href="https://github.com/mamedev/mame" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">MAME repository ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="about-credit-card">
          <h3>MiSTer and FPGA developers</h3>
          <p>
            Developers working on MiSTer and other FPGA arcade implementations
